        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Afm. plankje: 10 x 26.5 x 11 cm.\r\nVan dit instrument bestaat slechts 1 exemplaar.\r\nCatalogus: This is a wooden stand with a brass axis and two brass cylinders. A brass plate has been placed in between the two cylinders to earth the instrument. Pieces of Bakelite can be seen on the cylinders. Rotating the axis would activate the different electrodes that were connected to the patiënt. The different leads could be taken in the blink of an eye. THis instrument was probably a forerunner of the switchboards of the commercial electrocardiographs.",
      "classified_as": [
        {
          "id": "http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416",
          "type": "Type",
          "_label": "Description"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Op vetpotje: \"O\""
    }
